{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act9d0_level_act9d0_06_end",
  "groupId": "act9d0",
  "stageId": "act9d0_08",
  "title": "離散",
  "storyCode": "DM-8",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "48bce5e3f550034d68b45e513199eeaa96084360c79ff7965155c40bfc724d2d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "報告，我看過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "你們在整合運動那裡取得的成果，實在令人難以恭維。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "但，即使如此，你們也的確找到了一些預料之外的收獲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "感謝——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "啊啊，不用道謝，至少這次還不用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "你們也都是優秀的戰士，在死前，你們任何的獎賞都是你們的血與火所奪來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "攝政王殿下熟知每一個微不足道的薩卡茲所踐行的軌跡，即使你們太過微不足道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "在這座殿堂裡逐漸失去價值的，不光是那些感染者，你明白嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "......我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "如果我所猜沒錯，羅德島如今已經迎回了那個讓人不快的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "至於你們......你們應該有所接觸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "（攝政王比W還更快一步？在這麼遙遠的倫蒂尼姆——？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "雇傭兵僅僅效忠於利益。這種出發點，未必是什麼壞事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "等到塵埃落定，回到殿下的座前——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "——你就可以贏得你的獎賞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "......那其他的戰士們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "那位感染者青年有她自己的手腕，你們還沒有發覺嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "但殿下已無心深入這場鬧劇，殿下與我自有判斷，維多利亞將持續觀望整合運動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "我們缺乏從W手裡奪回那支隊伍控制權的......“高效手段”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "況且，我們依舊需要以支持者的名義，去煽動在大地各處活動的感染者們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "我們仍舊要利用整合運動？我以為這樣的發展會讓殿下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "放棄？不不不，年輕的雇傭兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "還不夠混亂，遠遠不夠。哪怕是遠離了領袖的整合運動，也依舊能成為禍亂的根源——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "——以及，剛才的言論，是否可以認作是對殿下的質詢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "不，不敢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "無妨，抬起頭來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "對了，對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "你暫時先不用回去了。漫長的路程會耽誤太多時間，而那裡發生的一切正在加速。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "就暫且留在這裡，享受你為數不多的清閒時間吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "......感激不盡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "那麼，殿下還在等我，原地解散吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "記住，先做好自己的事情，赫德雷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "......赫德雷，是嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_055",
      "text": "我很期待，你到底還能發現些什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這意思是......我們都被軟禁了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "我不是沒有考慮過，已經比想像中好很多了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "不過，我們還是太天真了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哪一邊天真？是誤以為自己會死，還是誤以為攝政王一無所知？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "都有，他......始終都掌握一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "也難怪......他可是特雷西斯。那些故事裡的他和特蕾西婭，是多麼的所向披靡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "只不過這場戰爭讓我們都忘了，那些故事......都不只是故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "該怎麼警告W？現在整合運動的事情又發展到哪一步了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們在路上花了很多時間，說不定現在她已經和塔露拉決裂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "又或者，這場鬧劇會在龍門被終結。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......會不會太快了點？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "這才符合W的規劃。如果塔露拉真的打算毀掉這些感染者，那W一定會先毀掉塔露拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "用薩卡茲的方式，不擇手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "畢竟因為某位傭兵的死，她很不高興。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她明明心裡有數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "時局至此，容不得她繼續猶豫下去。她只是缺乏一個動手的好心情而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但現在是我們落於被動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "有辦法。想騙過攝政王的眼睛，無論如何都非常冒險，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "我依舊有權對我的直屬小隊下達“待命”的指令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "維多利亞很混亂，暗號不容易被注意到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "不光如此，消息將會繞過攝政王所掌控的那些最敏感的地區......發向卡茲戴爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "卡茲戴爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "那裡的戰場廢墟早已經無人問津。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "但我們畢竟，在那裡掙扎了很久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "在某處廢墟下有一個秘密發報站，信號塔被偽裝成遭到破壞的樣子，線路完好無損。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等等，那時候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你什麼時候做好這些準備的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "從一開始，花了很大一筆錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......呵呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你啊......讓他們看到你現在的表情，應該都會很驚訝吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "從什麼時候開始，每次上戰場，再歸來，你永遠是一副若有所思的樣子，好像做錯了事的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我還以為，你會更加喪失鬥志。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "不，恰恰相反，我反而越來越明白我該做什麼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "因為我沒得選，這樣反而解脫了，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "W一定對你說了些什麼，在你離開切爾諾伯格之前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "你覺得她像是那種會和盤托出的人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不是。如果是，就沒今天這麼麻煩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "不過她的確在我離開核心城前找了我一次。那時候她已經察覺到我們的意思了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "她——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "雇傭兵的性命可以用價格來衡量嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "當然。一直以來。為什麼這麼問？你可是最懂得這個道理的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "可，誰來決定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "戰爭本身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "是啊......戰功，戰績，在廝殺中奪取名利，抬高身價，作為道具被他人認可。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "很無趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "但以後不再是了。至少我們，沒必要再是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "......什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "每一個薩卡茲雇傭兵都應該明碼標價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "但不必被他人賦予，也不用被他人操縱，他們應該親手寫下自己的價碼，用所有與薩卡茲為敵之人的鮮血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "你......你想讓這些人全都脫離卡茲戴爾......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "別這麼驚訝，只是讓那些傢伙自己做決定而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "很稀奇嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "不稀奇吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "你可以好好想想......好好想想你應該在卡茲戴爾做些什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "......那可是在特雷西斯的眼皮底下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "別這麼說，是你自己說你有打算的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "放輕鬆......你以前可是我的頭兒，赫德雷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "你最好做得到，不然接下來可就麻煩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......是個不錯的笑話。疤痕商場的老傢伙們都會笑到哮喘復發的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "委員會不會樂意看到這種情況發生的。他們付了不少錢，他們花了不少心思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們也殺了不少人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "是呢......還有那些老傢伙在，其中一些人其實和我們關係不錯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你又開始盤算什麼了，隨便你吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "嗯......不過我是不能離開倫蒂尼姆的，不，甚至不能離開那座宅邸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "這件事，只能你來做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "“信使”的身份還真是便利呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "“繼續聽從塔露拉的命令行動，赫德雷暫時不會歸隊”，應該沒問題吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "只要那處發報站還在運作，我們就會收到回訊，之後他們自會想辦法聯繫到W。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我知道該怎麼做......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不要命令我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "唉......真麻煩......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "好不容易決定去找那個龍女......你們還真是會挑時間啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "切爾諾伯格的廢墟，與卡茲戴爾稍有不同。\n街道上還殘留著生活的氣息，即使被摧殘至此，還是會有些過去的痕跡。\n至少不是徹底的毀滅。\n是的，比如......\n這兩個孩子。費力地舉著武器的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅強的孩子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——魔族，你想怎麼樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孱弱的孩子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不、不要挑釁她啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孱弱的孩子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊......對、對不起，我們會離開的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "嗯——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "你手裡拿著的，是把制式軍刀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "對了，是把薩卡茲的刀......你看，你根本舉不動，又何必拖著這個累贅呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "你想反抗嗎？你想殺了我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孱弱的孩子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "噫——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅強的孩子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別、別過——唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孱弱的孩子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "盧布廖夫......你的腿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "喔，你受傷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "被天災直擊後的切爾諾伯格可算不上安全，你會感染的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅強的孩子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我才不會變成你們這種人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "好。真是堅強的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "那你知道——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "——接手薩卡茲的佩刀，有什麼意義嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
